/>- Interpersonal skills: Communication, teamwork, and empathy<br\/>- Customer-service skills: Time management, active listening, and prioritization<br\/>- Leadership skills: Decision-making, stress management, and organization\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/skills-for-resume\/#faq-question-1716442419283\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/skills-for-resume\/#faq-question-1716442419283\",\"name\":\"3. How do I list my skills on a resume?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"- Ensure to include your best skills in a resume summary or objective. It's the most critical and first section of your resume.<br\/>- When writing your work experience section, use the PAR formula to build your accomplishment statements. That way, you will mention how you brought the results, which gives away your skill set.<br\/>- Create a list of skills in resume bullet points tailored to the job description.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/skills-for-resume\/#faq-question-1716442464534\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/skills-for-resume\/#faq-question-1716442464534\",\"name\":\"4. Where should I put skills on a resume?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It mainly depends on the resume format you choose while making your resume:<br\/><br\/>- Chronological Resume:\u00a0 Write your skills under the work experience section.<br\/>- Functional Resume: Write a skills sum-up below the career objective. Give a short description of every skill and explain how you used it.<br\/>- Combination Resume: Group your skills under the header and list several achievements to showcase your qualifications.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.